# Illidan's native checks by parity: #116 Mana Burn, #128 Immolate and glide, #147 Fel Rush.
# Illidan a against Illidan b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero illidan
# #116: the orb hits a standing b and stuns it.
60 a tap X 2
# #116 counterplay: b full-jumps the second orb.
200 a tap X 2
232 b tap B 8
# Both dash in, about 75 apart.
300 b stick -1 0
302 b stick 0 0
310 a stick 1 0
312 a stick 0 0
# #147: a Fel Rush into b's held shield stops short.
330 b shield 1
340 a stick 1 0
340 a tap X 2
341 a stick 0 0
420 b shield 0
# #147: a rush through b, then Vengeful Retreat (special on its frame 17).
470 a stick 1 0
470 a tap X 2
471 a stick 0 0
486 a tap X 2
# #147: a rush through b, then Chaos Strike (attack on its frame 17).
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
600 a stick 1 0
600 a tap X 2
601 a stick 0 0
616 a tap A 2
# #128: Immolate cancelled by a jump on its 6th frame.
720 a stick 0 -1
720 a tap X 2
721 a stick 0 0
725 a tap B 6
# #128: turn left, jump, Wing Ascent, glide on its 17th frame, wing slash.
800 a stick -0.5 0
804 a stick 0 0
840 a tap B 6
847 a stick 0 1
847 a tap X 2
848 a stick 0 0
863 a tap B 2
871 a tap A 2
